ntact"],[5.338,0.138,"as"],[5.487,0.087,"the"],[5.588,0.412,"mighty"],[6.013,0.4,"wind"],[6.862,0.388,"moving"],[7.263,0.475,"everywhere"],[7.75,0.075,"in"],[7.838,0.062,"the"],[7.912,0.475,"sky"],[8.875,0.562,"eternally"],[9.45,0.575,"remains"],[10.037,0.138,"in"],[10.188,0.625,"space"]]},{"b":5,"part":0,"text":"The theory of evolution and involution","start":87.216,"dur":2.832,"words":[[0.087,0.087,"The"],[0.188,0.438,"theory"],[0.637,0.087,"of"],[0.8,0.725,"evolution"],[1.538,0.188,"and"],[1.738,0.713,"involution"]]},{"b":6,"part":0,"text":"All beings merge into My Adi-Prakriti (primary material Nature) at the end of a cycle of just over 311 trillion solar years, O Arjuna, and I create them again at the beginning of the next cycle. I create the entire multitude of beings again and again with the help of My material Nature. These beings are under control of the three modes of material Nature. These acts of creation do not bind Me, O Arjuna, because I remain indifferent and unattached to those acts. The divine kinetic energy (Maya) — with the help of material Nature — creates all animate and inanimate objects under My supervision; thus, the creation keeps on going, O Arjuna.","start":90.048,"dur":44.76,"words":[[0.087,0.237,"All"],[0.338,0.362,"beings"],[0.713,0.438,"merge"],[1.163,0.188,"into"],[1.363,0.188,"My"],[1.562,0.787,"Adi-Prakriti"],[2.625,0.5,"primary"],[3.138,0.475,"material"],[3.612,0.438,"Nature"],[4.6,0.075,"at"],[4.688,0.075,"the"],[4.775,0.225,"end"],[5.013,0.037,"of"],[5.05,0.062,"a"],[5.125,0.487,"cycle"],[5.625,0.138,"of"],[5.775,0.275,"just"],[6.075,0.237,"over"],[6.312,1.075,"311"],[7.4,0.475,"trillion"],[7.888,0.362,"solar"],[8.262,0.512,"years"],[9.287,0.138,"O"],[9.425,0.6,"Arjuna"],[10.375,0.2,"and"],[10.588,0.087,"I"],[10.688,0.35,"create"],[11.05,0.113,"them"],[11.162,0.425,"again"],[11.6,0.125,"at"],[11.738,0.075,"the"],[11.825,0.438,"beginning"],[12.275,0.075,"of"],[12.35,0.062,"the"],[12.425,0.275,"next"],[12.7,0.463,"cycle"],[13.637,